      "sourceText": "Middara uses an accumulative Damage system. When an Adventurer or Combatant takes Damage, Damage tokens are added to their card to represent the total amount of Damage a figure has been dealt. If an Adventurer or Combatant has 0 Damage tokens, the figure is at full Health (HP). A figure may never Gain more Damage tokens than their maximum HP.",
